WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Maya: We will review onboarding and billing.

2
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Leo: Onboarding testing starts Tuesday.

3
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Maya: What changed?

4
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Leo: Shorter setup and clearer permissions.

5
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Maya: Recruit five trial users.

6
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Leo: I will include founders and operators.

7
00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:06.000
Maya: Findings are due Friday.

8
00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Nina: Profile abandonment is 42 percent.

9
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Nina: Welcome-screen abandonment is 11 percent.

10
00:02:42.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Maya: Make profile fields optional.

11
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:18.000
Leo: Keep company size required?

12
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:36.000
Maya: Yes, request other fields later.

13
00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:54.000
Nina: Success means completion and day-seven retention.

14
00:03:54.000 --> 00:04:12.000
Nina: I will also track activation.

15
00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:30.000
Leo: Variants will be ready Wednesday.

16
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:48.000
Leo: The API already accepts null values.

17
00:04:48.000 --> 00:05:06.000
Maya: Nina owns the metric brief.

18
00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:24.000
Maya: Leo owns usability findings.

19
00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:42.000
Leo: The billing sandbox is unstable.

20
00:05:42.000 --> 00:06:00.000
Leo: Retry tests duplicate invoice events.

21
00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:18.000
Maya: Does this risk August 28?

22
00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:36.000
Leo: Yes, if it continues after Thursday.

23
00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:54.000
Leo: We may need idempotency work.

24
00:06:54.000 --> 00:07:12.000
Nina: Keep old invoice mappings for Finance.

25
00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:30.000
Nina: Dual reporting complicates reconciliation.

26
00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:48.000
Maya: Escalate blockers immediately.

27
00:07:48.000 --> 00:08:06.000
Maya: Bring a recommendation Thursday.

28
00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:24.000
Leo: Fallback moves only new subscriptions.

29
00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:42.000
Leo: Existing subscriptions stay put.

30
00:08:42.000 --> 00:09:00.000
Maya: Finance must approve the fallback.

31
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:18.000
Nina: I meet Finance tomorrow.

32
00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:36.000
Nina: Recommendation is due Monday.

33
00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:54.000
Nina: I will segment enterprise trials.

34
00:09:54.000 --> 00:10:12.000
Maya: That helps interpret results.

35
00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:30.000
Leo: Support needs release notes.

36
00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:48.000
Maya: Explain that profile questions moved.

37
00:10:48.000 --> 00:11:06.000
Nina: I will draft the support note.

38
00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:24.000
Maya: Ask support to flag confusion.

39
00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:42.000
Leo: Billing tests run again tomorrow.

40
00:11:42.000 --> 00:12:00.000
Leo: I will post results before Thursday.

41
00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:18.000
Maya: What triggers the fallback?

42
00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:36.000
Leo: Unstable sandbox or untested idempotency.

43
00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:54.000
Nina: Finance needs reconciliation steps.

44
00:12:54.000 --> 00:13:12.000
Maya: Add cost to the decision document.

45
00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:30.000
Leo: I own testing and billing escalation.

46
00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:48.000
Nina: I own metrics and Finance alignment.

47
00:13:48.000 --> 00:14:06.000
Maya: Review onboarding Monday.

48
00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:24.000
Maya: Decide billing Thursday.

49
00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:42.000
Leo: I will send a recap.

50
00:14:42.000 --> 00:15:00.000
Maya: Raise blockers early.
